  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your additional health from a rage does not end immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Raging Vitality<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You do not lose your bonus to Constitution from raging for one minute per mythic tier after the end of your rage. You never get to apply more than one bonus to Constitution from raging at a time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-rage-feats#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
